            "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef main():\n    vectors = np.load(\"vectors.npy\")\n    X = vectors.astype(np.float64)\n    del vectors\n\n    norms = np.sum(X**2, axis=1)\n\n    # Compute Gram matrix G = X @ X.T\n    G = X @ X.T\n    del X\n\n    # In-place compute squared Euclidean distances: ||x_i - x_j||^2 = ||x_i||^2 + ||x_j||^2 - 2 <x_i, x_j>\n    G *= -2.0\n    G += norms[:, None]\n    G += norms[None, :]\n    del norms\n\n    np.fill_diagonal(G, 0.0)\n    np.maximum(G, 0.0, out=G)\n    np.sqrt(G, out=G)\n\n    total = float(np.sum(G))\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
